    "text": "IT is hereby informed, according to sub section (2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance chapter 267, that the following proposalwhich is decided by the secretary of the Waththegama Urban Council, in terms of the provisions of Section 2 (1) of the aboveOrdinance, has been accepted by the Minister in-charge for the subject of local governments of the provincial council of thecentral province, in terms of the provisions of sub section (2) of the said ordinance.",
