    "text": "I have decided to levy an Entertainment Tax of 20 % from the ticket fee (with out entertainment tax) within the limits ofthe Waththegama Urban Council, in terms of the powers vested to me according to chapter 255, section 27 (3) of the UrbanCouncil act and in terms of provisions of section 2 (1) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946 further amended bythe entertainment tax act No. 37 of 1984.",
